laurel 2300: SPMI reads of the PMI632 (SID 2) battery, charger, ADC and SDAM blocks, and owner-checked writes. sweet_spmi_read took SID 0 only (the PM6150 map of sweet): on the Mi A3 the gauge and the charger are at SID 2 (pmi632.dtsi), so no battery register was reachable even with the trinket arbiter bases of 2018. New: sweet_spmi_owner() (ownership table cnfg 0x700 + 4 * APID) and sweet_spmi_write() (EXT_WRITEL on the APID's rw channel, only EE 0 APIDs, only the SMB5 FCC/FV/ICL/input-suspend registers and the hard JEITA thresholds, the VADC conversion request and our SDAM record 0xa8..0xaf). A lock-free lane to USBIN_CMD_IL 0x1340 releases the charger input suspend in the power-off/restart path. Reads and writes keep the lock and the per-APID poison of the topaz reader.

